              alt 允许自动回复
                Brain --> C3: send_reply + approved reply_text
                C3 -> Reply: 创建当前batch唯一reply_action\nstatus=queued
                C3 --> W: batch terminal=reply_action_created\nreply_action_id
              else 高风险/低置信/Guard阻断原文
